  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Looking for a pair of combat boots that are up to the challenge? If so, take pride in each step with Rothco&rsquo;s Sierra Sole Tactical Boots. Designed for hot and dry desert environments, these military combat boots can also tackle any landscape. Whether you are in the military, law enforcement, public safety, or just looking for a sturdy work boot, this tactical combat boot is the ideal choice. They&rsquo;re great for rucking, mountain climbing, camping, hiking, field work, everyday wear, and more.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "20880",
  "description": "<p>Looking for a pair of combat boots that are up to the challenge? If so, take pride in each step with Rothco&rsquo;s Sierra Sole Tactical Boots. Designed for hot and dry desert environments, these military combat boots can also tackle any landscape. Whether you are in the military, law enforcement, public safety, or just looking for a sturdy work boot, this tactical combat boot is the ideal choice. They&rsquo;re great for rucking, mountain climbing, camping, hiking, field work, everyday wear, and more.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Boots on the Ground:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These tactical outdoor combat boots feature a Sierra lug outsole with a rugged tread pattern for improved grip and traction to prevent you from slipping or falling while you&rsquo;re on the move.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Tough &amp; Long-Lasting:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The upper section of the military field boot is constructed with nylon and leather materials (Desert Tan is Suede Leather), providing unbeatable strength and durability. The boot&rsquo;s midsole heat barrier keeps your feet cool and protected from harsh climates. The removable cushion insole ensures all-day comfort, be it in the desert or other outdoor locations.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Comfortable Foot Support:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>With an overall height of 8 inches, this rugged desert combat boot provides high ankle support when securely tied with the nylon-coated brass speed-hook and eyelet lacing system. The padded collar further enhances this support and protection around the ankle.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Staying on Your Toes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Designed with precision and built to withstand the harshest conditions, Rothco's collection of footwear combines durability, functionality, and unparalleled performance. From our Forced Entry Series which features our speedlace and waterproof technologies, to our V-Max Collection designed with lightweight running shoe soles, our diverse range of footwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts. With a rich heritage spanning over seven decades, Rothco is the go-to brand for all things that keep you standing on your feet.</li>\n</ul>",
